# SPA fallback, shipped INSIDE dist/ as well as in netlify.toml.
#
# netlify.toml only applies when Netlify runs the build itself. A drag-and-drop
# or `netlify deploy --dir=web/dist` upload never reads it, and then every route
# but "/" would 404 on refresh. This file travels with the bundle, so the
# fallback cannot be lost depending on how the site was deployed.
/*  /index.html  200
